{"id":"religio_n","lemma":"religión","pos":"noun","rank":2152,"glosses":["religion"],"ipa":"/reliˈxjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"religiones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/87/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-religi%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Hacer dinero es su religión.","en":"Making money is his religion.","words":[null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"to make money"]]},{"text":"¡No me hables de religión!","en":"Don't talk to me about religion.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586893","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to talk","l":"hablar"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"En este país no hay libertad de religión.","en":"There's no freedom of religion in this country.","words":[{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"this"},{"g":"country"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"liberty, freedom"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"En muchas religiones, el adulterio es pecado.","en":"In many religions adultery is a sin.","words":[{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"adultery"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"sin"}]},{"text":"A veces desearía profesar otra religión.","en":"Sometimes I wish I had a different religion.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/64808","words":[null,null,{"g":"to wish","l":"desear"},null,{"g":"someone else","l":"otro"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"sometimes"]]}]}